'''Clionel Dominant''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]] and appears on the 7th, 8th, 21st and 22nd days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[No Plan A (Deadly)|Clionel Ascendant]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Catway (Super Rare Cat)|Catway]], Time Traveller Cat.

