==Appears==
===Japanese Version===
*The 3rd, 4th, 17th, and 18th days in any month
*First appearance: ?

===English Version===
*The 7th, 8th, 21st and 22nd days in any month
*First appearance: March 21st, 2019 to March 22nd, 2019

==Trivia==
*Like [[No Plan A (Deadly)|No Plan A]], [[New Testament (Deadly)|New Testament]]'s Japanese name contains the phrase Neko Hokan Keikaku (ネコ補完計画, "Cat Complementary Project"), a reference to the Japanese name of ''[[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Neon Genesis Evangelion]]''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s [https://wiki.evageeks.org/Human_Instrumentality_Project Human Instrumentality Project], Jinrui Hokan Keikaku (人類補完計画, "Human Complementary Project").
*[[A Cat Screaming Love (Merciless)|A Cat Screaming Love]]'s name comes from ''[[wikipedia:The Beast that Shouted Love at the Heart of the World (short story)|The Beast that Shouted Love at the Heart of the World]]'', a story by Harlan Ellison, and—more relevantly—the title of [https://wiki.evageeks.org/Episode_26 Episode 26] of ''Neon Genesis Evangelion''.

